# The ABI tooling's virtualenv (capstone). Recreated with
#   python3 -m venv scripts/abi/.venv && scripts/abi/.venv/bin/pip install capstone
# The tools themselves and tahoe-26.6-slots.txt are tracked; only the venv is not.
scripts/abi/.venv

# Archived kernel collections, kept so a release's layout stays disassemblable after
# the OS that shipped it has been updated over. Tens of megabytes each and Apple's
# binaries, so never committed — but do not delete them either: the text baselines
# (scripts/abi/abi-*.txt) answer vtable questions only, and kdis/findfield/wclfsm/
# slotcall all need the collection itself. The .sha256 beside each one is tracked.
scripts/abi/kc/*.kc
scripts/abi/kc/*.kc.elides

# Transient local files needed for a one-off task but not durable documentation —
# captured logs, ad hoc scratch output, etc. Subfoldered by category (e.g. logs/).
# Never committed; make subfolders under here freely instead of dropping files at
# the repo root or reusing a directory that has a real meaning elsewhere.
scratch/
